{"title": "Demonspirit (Condition)", "pageid": 23441, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Demonspirit_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has tick type", "Conditions", "Wisdom saving throws"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Demonspirit Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Demonspirit</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity's summoned creature has <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to all damage except <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a>.</li>\n<li>At the start of the summoned creature's turn, it must succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Wisdom Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> or be driven <a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\">Mad</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_ZHENTARIM_DEMONSPIRIT</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CMAG_ZHENTARIM_DEMONSPIRIT%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CMAG_ZHENTARIM_DEMONSPIRIT%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: start of turn</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Demonspirit_Madness\">Condition: Demonspirit Madness</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Demonspirit Madness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\">Demonspirit Madness</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"WIS Save (DC&nbsp;10)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">WIS</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;10)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has been driven to a frenzy by magical madness. It will attack the nearest creature on its turn.</li>\n<li>At the end of each turn, the affected entity makes a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Wisdom Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>. On a successful save, the condition is removed.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The summon itself is the one that gets this buff.</li>\n<li>If the summon fails the Wisdom Saving Throw, it will get the condition <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Demonspirit Madness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\">Demonspirit Madness</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Demonspirit\">Sources of Demonspirit</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"min-width: 30px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Demonspirit Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Aura (Condition)\">Demonspirit Aura</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202814\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usag